# Datum-authored terminfo source for the production Datum TerminalCore surface.
#
# This entry deliberately advertises only behavior implemented and covered by
# Datum's native terminal specification. The compiled database entry is embedded
# in datum-gui and materialized inside each session context directory; child
# programs never depend on the launching emulator's TERM identity or a host
# terminfo package.
